{title: Raat Baaki Baat Baaki}
{artist: Asha Bhosle Bappi Lahiri Namak Halal}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#],        Raat baki baat baki
[B] [C#],        Hona hai jo ho jane do
[F#],        Socho na dekho to dekho haan
[A] [B] [C#],        jane ja mujhe pyaar se
[B] [C#],        Kashti jawa dil ki tufa se takra gayi
[B] [C#],        Manzil mohabbaat ki ab to karib aa gayi
[F#] [B] [C#],        Aa dekh le hai kya maza dil har ke
[B] [C#],        Aagaz yeh hai to anjaam hoga haseen
[B] [C#],        Diwane parwane marne se darte nahi
[F#] [B] [C#],        Aa dilruba khul ke zara mil yaar se
